Z||000013||Old Lar||05-23-2001||04:18 PM||||When Alex was in the states, he was based in North Carolina and attended many Fiero shows 4 or 5 years ago.  He designed, made the cars and kits for sale.  Every one loved the car but very few in the Fiero community would come up with the cash for the car. Alex's visa ran out and he returned to Russia.  The finished product, like V8 Archies cars were in the $20K-30 price range, depending on options, which may be too much for a limited production car that you want to drive and bang around in.||||reg||10
